    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúhúng nu hardahaas baraá yaamuudá' kuungá' tay hotaá eera', nee xoordaá yaariir awa baraadá' gi guus. Qoomár bara daté' baraá yaamuudá', inós xoorduudá' faanqw /uuruú koomá' ta kuungae gi guus. Inooín an xoorór Hiti, nee xoorór Girgashi, nee xoorór Amori, nee xoorór Kana'ani, nee xoorór Perisi, nee xoorór Hifi nee xoorór Yebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám qoomár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng birnga haniís gawaá dabaahúng mukdá' kway balé', ku hhaamisá', al'axweesani tam ar niiná ma qaasara', nee inooín mi baloó gurtlawaara'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dasuuhúng mukuwa duxuút nee daaqay'ín, laqaá daaqayhúng dasuuín munguwa duxuút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí bara tlehhé', inooín na/iihúng ki qwaarees, nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ inooín ngu eehariaaká, munguaá hatlá' ngiri eehariyá', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri daa/atúy buhhtaawo, aluuwo Mungú kuungá' nu hhaamiis ar wa'aá wák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala adoorí ti tlehhe': Kiteeri'ín kudá' ilahhooa amór saaw tay fe/e', nee uheemi giqawaak. Slaqsi'iidaá Ashera amór saaw ti kwahhe', nee slaqsi'iidá' taa dakuút ar daba', da/aak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí tleehhaak, asma kuungá' tunda paraátl as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng. Kuungá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nuna tsawaár baraá tla/ángw xoorduuwo as tawa mukós oo kilá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuungá' naa slaiiká nee naa tsawaariiká as kuungá' tunduwa yaariír ta xoordaá hatlae, kuungá' tundun ló'wa niiná ta xoordaá hatlae, kuká' gawaá daanduú yaamií diriiá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuungá' nuna slaá' asma al'axweesantadá' aáng aa alqadín dír baabi'iihúng, an gár nusa ba/amís ar /uuruuwós kudá' úr, nee nuri baraá lawaali'iimár wa tuú/, baraá dabaá waawutmo Farao oo Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimsé, xuaak AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, inós an Mungú, a Munguú inkihhimuú koóm, kudá' alqadoorós gaa oh nee sla'aarír warqawaaká gan laqaaqán ay qari sleémeero, dír mukdá' inós gu slaá' nee hara'ayaarós gaa oh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mukdá' sleémeero inós gu ahhiít, muxtaaro i baabaqasiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe ti harmagahhe' hara'ayaarós nee dabeerose, nee kaahirós tidá' aníng naa kuungií hara'ayiím laarí na iialooeesaak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuungá' kaahirí bara oté' ar ilakaahara, nee adoodá' kari tlehhé', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng alqadoorós ga oh daanduhunge, nee sla'aarirós ar warqawaaká ngin laqán, adoodá' aáng ngira lo'ór wa /aáy dír baabi'iihúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' nuri slaa' nee nuri tsuuq, kuungá' tari ló'wa tláhh, nee na/iihúng niri tlahhiyá', qamuuhúng giri tsuuq as kuungá' balaangw kuwa sleera', nee difaái, nee di/to, kuungá' nu tsuuq as hikwa nee bee/aangw ngiwa haniisi baraá yaamuudá' aa al'axweés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' tundun tsuuq ta muu sleémeero oo daanduú yaamuwo. Baraá tla/angwhunge hhawaata laqaá /ameenír xwayluwaaká i káhh, laqaá hikwaahúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tiqti sleémeero ga hingees dirhunge, nee kuungá' tiqtír nu slaw i káhh tam ar niiná ar dae tlaaq adór tidá' kuungá' naa sleer qoomár tawa baraá yaamaá Misrír i diria'. Ala inós wakuuserhúng ga tiqtidií tlees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xooro tam gaalá ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng naa gawaá dabaahúng i haniís hhaamiisaak, ma baloó gurtlawaara'. Mungui'ín mi sluufmiisara', asma gár adór tí dirhunge a tsaaxweelír kuungá' nu ohiim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ma baraá munerhúng i kaahara', ‹Mukwí ku úr ta atene. Xáy, guusaro adór ngir aslawan baraá yaamuukae a adoomá?› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi da'ayumiitaara', inslawaak adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng aa tleéhh dír Farao nee yaamu sleémeero awa xoorór Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inslawaak muxtaadá' tlakw ilahunge taa aandé', muruú waa/oo/amo nee layudá' uren, nee /uuruú úr nee aleesleemuú úr kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ira gadiyuús qoomár nuwa baraá yaamaá Misrír wa tuú/. Adoorí an adoodá' i tleehhi dír mukdá' kuungá' ta da'ayumiita'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, diwíl gwaa tleés amór mukdá' aa kuungá' wa goow aa nahhamiít as ngiwa hhaamisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimsé', mi da'ayumiitaara', asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng i baraá tla/angwhúng i dirii'. Inós an Munguú úr nee kudá' dae tlaaq. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng xoorduuká' gusisiingo gin tseegamiis har qoomár kuungá' tar geerií surkuunda'. Xoorduuká' gi wa'aá wákár hhaamisiiká, as kahhó' aluuwo kuungá' mutunduwa haradáh nee makaá sla/a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, wakuuserhúng ngi gawaá dabaahúng i haniis giri amoqwaarees ay dír ngay hhaamisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós waawitaáín ngu gawaá dabaahúng i haniis, kuungá' kiri tsu/á', nee inooín kiri gunqarees. Heé inooín baqto gi aleesláw i kaahh, ay dír kuungá' inooín kay hhaamisa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsi'ii'ín kudá' taa dakuút awa mungui, da/aak. Peésaadá' kira tleéhh, nee sahaábuwo, mi ilatleeruusara', laqaá muruuín kwí mu ar tlawaara' as tawa koohúng. Adoorí bara tlehhé' a tsaaxweeli dirhunge, nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ga waak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsi'iidá' mi ar watlaara' amór marayhúng, laqaá bar adooriheeká, kuungá' tundu adór slaqsi'iidá' wa lu'us. Kuungá' masók aqo in siá' nee kiri waaqaqa'á' asma tawa muruú taa lu'ús.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
